      improvements to it open.

  (2) validate.js, all scripts, and all build tooling are licensed
      under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

      This protects the code and allows companies to use the tools
      freely.

The full texts of both licenses are provided in this repository:

  - Apache License 2.0: see LICENSE-APACHE-2.0
  - Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 4.0 International:
    see LICENSE-CC-BY-SA-4.0

If you are unsure which license applies to a file, default to the terms
of the Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 4.0 International license.
